  "summary_en": "Journal article on the ethics of tactile human–robot interaction in soft robotics. It argues designers must balance tactile engagement against emotional manipulation, model intimacy as bonding with a tool rather than a person, and deflect destructive user behaviour, using bonding, function and social-norm modelling as rubrics, with sex robots as a case.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
