   "Soft robots should balance tactile engagement against emotional manipulation.",
   "Intimacy should be modelled on bonding with a tool, not a person.",
   "Designers should deflect users from destructive behaviour that soft bodies may invite.",
   "Framework rubrics: bonding, specifying function, modeling social norms."
  ],
